WEBVTT

00:04:28.863 --> 00:04:30.506
even by a crumb,

00:04:30.530 --> 00:04:32.236
I was furious.

00:04:32.260 --> 00:04:34.363
It wasn't fair.

00:04:34.387 --> 00:04:37.402
And the childhood me is not alone.

00:04:37.704 --> 00:04:42.132
We humans hate getting
less than another so much

00:04:42.156 --> 00:04:43.950
that one study found

00:04:43.974 --> 00:04:46.703
that if humans were given
a hypothetical choice

00:04:46.727 --> 00:04:48.894
between earning 50,000 dollars a year

00:04:48.918 --> 00:04:51.155
while others earned 25,000 dollars,

00:04:51.179 --> 00:04:53.441
or earning 100,000 dollars a year

00:04:53.465 --> 00:04:56.227
while others earned 250,000 dollars,

00:04:56.251 --> 00:04:58.323
nearly half the subjects

00:04:58.347 --> 00:05:02.077
prefer to earn 50,000 dollars
a year less money